    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>General Feat (Prerequisite: Level 4+)</em></p><p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase your Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Telepathic Utterance.</strong> You can speak telepathically to any creature you can see within 60 feet of you. You speak in a language you know, and the creature understands you only if it knows that language. This doesn't let the creature answer you telepathically.</p><p><strong>Detect Thoughts.</strong> You always have @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplDetectThou]{Detect Thoughts} prepared. You can cast it without a spell slot or components, and you must finish a Long Rest before you can cast it this way again; you can also cast it with spell slots of the appropriate level you have. Its spellcasting ability is the ability increased by this feat.</p>",
